# A Tern presence card on the node's Identity card. The name on a card is its sender's claim, not
# a name the user gave, so it is a row of its own - quoted, with how long ago the radio took it -
# beside the node's name and never in its place.

scene demo
clock 2026-01-15 12:00
protocol tern
card ECHO Trail crew · ask me
tab nodes
# Echo Repeater is seeds[5], so row 6 under the chip bar.
key down 6
key a
hold 1200
# Through to Identity.
key right
key right
key right
key right
hold 1600
